RUF079 [*] Use `Generator` instead of `Iterator` for a context manager
 --> RUF079_cross_module.py:7:22
  |
6 | @contextmanager
7 | def synchronous() -> Iterator[int]:
  |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
8 |     yield 1
  |
help: Replace with `Generator`
  |
6 | @contextmanager
  - def synchronous() -> Iterator[int]:
7 + def synchronous() -> Generator[int, None, None]:
8 |     yield 1
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

